					<li Class="StandardLetter">
						<ID>361</ID>
						<def>PositiveEvent</def>
						<label>Bandit camp quest</label>
						<lookTargets>
							<targets>
								<li>@WorldObject_230</li>
							</targets>
						</lookTargets>
						<relatedFaction>Faction_6</relatedFaction>
						<arrivalTick>10610000</arrivalTick>
						<text>Trobo, chief of Confederation of Canto, has sent us a message.

Apparently bandits based in a nearby camp have been raiding their caravans. They've asked us to destroy it, which means eliminating all enemies and turrets.

Trobo says that there is an enemy outpost at the site guarded by 10 enemies.

If we succeed, their relations will improve, and they'll send us this reward worth $1800:

Uranium x75
Plasteel x150

If we don't destroy the camp in 24 days, they will do it themselves.</text>
					</li>
					<li Class="StandardLetter">
						<ID>362</ID>
						<def>NegativeEvent</def>
