						<relatedFaction>null</relatedFaction>
						<arrivalTick>10651000</arrivalTick>
						<text>Every colonist of the male gender smiles with contentment!

Some distant engine of happiness is stirring. It is projecting a powerful psychic drone over this entire region, on a frequency that only seems to affect the male gender. For a few days, some people's mood will be quite a bit better.</text>
