							</targets>
						</lookTargets>
						<relatedFaction>Faction_4</relatedFaction>
						<arrivalTick>10654000</arrivalTick>
						<text>A nearby settlement, Goter, contacts you with a special trade request. They would like to purchase:

  Modified shirt x21 (normal quality or better) (not tainted) (worth $2439)

In return, they offer:

  Psychic emanator, vanometric power cell, orbital power beam targeter, and marine helmet (excellent) (worth $4655)

This request expires after: 20 days

If you want to make the trade, send a caravan with the requested supplies. The estimated travel time is 5.1 days. You can review this offer by selecting Goter on the world map.</text>
					</li>
